OL,3,GNEWSACompletion of roof on wildlife
OL,4,Ahospital marked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe completion of the roof on a
OL,7,Fcharity's wildlife hospital was marked
OL,8,Fby a topping out ceremony on Thursday.
OL,10,FThe Guernsey Society for the Prevention
OL,11,Fof Cruelty to Animals (GSPCA) has been
OL,12,Ffundraising for new facilities
OL,13,Fincluding the purpose-built hospital
OL,14,Fdesigned to treat puffins, hedgehogs,
OL,15,Fseals and birds, among other wildlife.
OL,17,FGSPCA manager Steve Byrne said now the
OL,18,Fbuilding was watertight and the roof
OL,19,Fwas on he hoped parts of the facility
OL,20,Fwould be open by the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
