OL,3,GNEWSACompletion of roof on wildlife
OL,4,Ahospital marked
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said "we've been working out of
OL,7,Ftemporary facilities for two years" and
OL,8,Fthe rooms that were nearly done
OL,9,Fincluded those dedicated to the care of
OL,10,Fseals.
